{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"d078ef6781167ad064cf6da48c6ae0fd56b267b5736efac0fe48bbacc8a874ab","digest":{"component_or_area":"Reconcile Bridge CI/CD & CloudWatch Observability","key_entities":[".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","infra/terraform/iam_bridge_metrics.tf","infra/terraform/monitoring_bridge.tf","aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.github","rebar/host:bridge_run_failures","rebar-bridge-metrics","rebar-bridge-run-failures","cloudwatch:PutMetricData","AWS_BRIDGE_METRICS_ROLE_ARN","AWS_BRIDGE_METRICS_REGION"],"problem_keywords":["cloudwatch metrics","github actions","monitoring","observability","bridge failure detection","oidc authentication"],"propositions":["Reconcile Bridge runs on GitHub Actions without CloudWatch instrumentation, leaving failures invisible to monitoring systems.","Bridge authentication failures (e.g. expired Jira API tokens) produced zero CloudWatch signals during the 2026-08-12 outage, making incident detection impossible.","GitHub Actions workflow must publish bridge_run_failures metric (1 on failure, 0 on success) to rebar/host namespace via OIDC-assumed CloudWatch role.","A new narrowly-scoped IAM role must grant only cloudwatch:PutMetricData action restricted to rebar/host namespace, without widening existing drift-detection or Bedrock CI roles.","CloudWatch alarm on bridge_run_failures must trigger on second failure within 3600s (period 3600, threshold 1) to distinguish transient blips from sustained outages like expired credentials."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787712150750050001,"uuid":"5e7fd002-e3f2-44a3-80d9-70bba6063e6a"}